  "label": "User projected onto the violent textual message",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material that delivers the violent and misleading message, as the meme's intent is to make the viewer identify with or internalize the aggressive advice attributed to the Dalai Lama. The text 'shoot until the threat changes shape or catches fire. only then will your enemies know true peace' uses 'your enemies' which directly addresses the user, creating a deictic projection of the user onto the violent advice.",
